 to respond:<br><span class=\"italic\">Of course.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Certainly.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Right away.</span><br><span class=\"italic\"> Yes.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Very good, Miss.</span><br>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ravenous "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "starving; very hungry "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm ravenous ... I have to eat!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use at a Japanese restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tempura "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a Japanese dish of fish or vegetables fried in light batter "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd like to try the shrimp tempura, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "teriyaki "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a Japanese dish stir-fried in a special sauce "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to try the chicken teriyaki."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chopsticks"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "two small sticks used for eating food "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am not good at eating with chopsticks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "set menu "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a menu with a set course of food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here